rc-plc/idaho/canyon-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, July to August came in under 90% of normal in 42 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle ran 35% of normal for May to June and 162% for July to August. In 2026 so far, May to June sits at 43% on the middle. Grid 27954 had its driest year in 2002, at 48% of normal.</p>"}
